---
import ToolLayout from '../../layouts/ToolLayout.astro';
---

<ToolLayout title="图片压缩到指定 KB" description="免费图片压缩工具，支持压缩到 200KB、自定义目标大小、批量 JPEG / WebP / PNG 和等比尺寸调整。图片在本地处理，不上传服务器。" currentSlug="image-compress">
  <h1 slot="header">图片压缩</h1>
  <p class="intro">压缩到指定 KB，或手动调整质量。先调质量，再按需等比缩小；图片只在你的浏览器中处理。</p>

  <div class="compress-workspace batch-workspace" id="compress-wrap">
    <div class="compress-panel">
      <div class="field-label">原图（可多选）</div>
      <label class="img-slot img-slot-upload" id="compress-drop">
        <input type="file" id="compress-file" accept="image/*" multiple aria-label="选择要压缩的图片，可多选" />
        <span id="compress-placeholder">点击或拖拽上传，可多选</span>
      </label>
      <div class="batch-grid cols-1" id="compress-src-grid"></div>
      <div class="img-meta" id="compress-meta">—</div>
    </div>

    <div class="compress-panel compress-controls">
      <div class="target-settings">
        <label class="compress-check"><input type="checkbox" id="compress-use-target" checked /> 按目标大小压缩</label>
        <label class="field-label" for="compress-target">每张不超过 (KB)</label>
        <input type="number" id="compress-target" min="0.1" max="102400" step="any" value="200" aria-describedby="compress-target-help" />
        <p class="control-help" id="compress-target-help">1 KB = 1024 字节；200 KB = 204800 字节。以实际导出字节数判断是否达标。</p>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary" id="compress-preset" type="button">200KB JPEG 常用预设</button>
        <label class="compress-check"><input type="checkbox" id="compress-auto-resize" checked /> 质量不足时允许继续等比缩小</label>
        <p class="control-help">取消勾选后固定计算出的尺寸。若最低质量仍超限，会明确标记未达标。</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label class="field-label" for="compress-quality"><span id="quality-label">最高质量</span> <span class="range-val" id="quality-val">92%</span></label>
        <div class="range-row"><input type="range" id="compress-quality" min="10" max="100" value="92" /></div>
        <p class="control-help" id="compress-quality-help">目标模式会在 10% 至此质量之间搜索。PNG 无质量压缩，只能通过缩小尺寸降低大小。</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label class="field-label" for="compress-scale">尺寸比例 <span class="range-val" id="scale-val">100%</span></label>
        <div class="range-row"><input type="range" id="compress-scale" min="10" max="100" value="100" /></div>
      </div>
      <div class="size-input-row">
        <div><label class="field-label" for="size-w">最大宽 (px)</label><input type="number" id="size-w" min="1" max="16384" step="1" placeholder="按比例" /></div>
        <div><label class="field-label" for="size-h">最大高 (px)</label><input type="number" id="size-h" min="1" max="16384" step="1" placeholder="按比例" /></div>
      </div>
      <p class="control-help">填写宽高时优先按边界等比适配，不拉伸、不裁剪、不放大；留空则使用尺寸比例。自动缩小可能让输出低于这些尺寸。</p>
      <div>
        <label class="field-label" for="compress-format">输出格式</label>
        <select id="compress-format"><option value="image/jpeg">JPEG</option><option value="image/webp">WebP</option><option value="image/png">PNG</option></select>
        <p class="control-help">JPEG 的透明区域填充白色；PNG / WebP 保留透明。动图仅导出静态画面，原文件保持不变。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-row compress-btn-row">
        <button class="btn" id="btn-compress" type="button">全部压缩</button>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary" id="btn-compress-dl" type="button" hidden>批量下载</button>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary" id="btn-compress-clear" type="button" hidden>清空</button>
      </div>
      <div id="compress-msg" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="compress-panel">
      <div class="field-label">压缩结果（点击查看详情）</div>
      <div class="batch-grid cols-1" id="compress-out-grid"><span class="img-meta" style="grid-column:1/-1">等待压缩</span></div>
      <div class="img-meta" id="compress-out-meta">—</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="compress-summary" id="compress-summary" style="display:none" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <section class="section">
    <h2>如何压缩到 200KB 以内？</h2>
    <p>点击「200KB JPEG 常用预设」后选择图片。工具会先在当前尺寸下调整 JPEG 质量，仍超限时再等比缩小，最后用实际文件大小检查结果。网站若同时要求固定尺寸，可关闭「允许继续等比缩小」并检查尺寸与达标状态。</p>
    <p>目标过小、固定尺寸或 PNG 格式都可能无法达到大小限制。未达标结果仍可下载，但不会显示为达标。请以目标网站的尺寸、格式及字节限制为准；本工具不判断证件照背景、姿态或人像内容是否符合审核要求。</p>
    <p>处理、预览与打包均在浏览器本地进行，不上传图片；重新编码会移除常见 EXIF 等原始元数据。下载使用安全处理后的原文件名，重名自动编号。</p>
  </section>
</ToolLayout>

<style>
  #compress-wrap { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(280px, .9fr) minmax(0, 1fr); }
  .compress-panel { min-width: 0; }
  #compress-target { width: 100%; min-width: 0; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: var(--mono); }
  .size-input-row { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .size-input-row > div { min-width: 0; }
  .target-settings { display: grid; gap: .65rem; padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; }
  .compress-check { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: .5rem; font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .compress-check input { flex-shrink: 0; width: auto; margin-top: .3rem; }
  .control-help { margin: .25rem 0 0; font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--muted); }
  #compress-out-meta { overflow-wrap: anywhere; line-height: 1.7; }
  #compress-wrap :global(.batch-thumb) { aspect-ratio: auto; min-height: 80px; text-align: left; }
  #compress-wrap :global(.batch-thumb img) { height: 160px; object-fit: contain; }
  #compress-wrap :global(.batch-thumb-cap) { position: static; display: block; color: var(--text); background: none; padding-top: .5rem; }
  #compress-wrap :global(.compression-detail) { display: block; padding: .3rem .45rem; font-size: .72rem; line-height: 1.5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  #compress-wrap :global(.batch-thumb.is-error .compression-detail) { color: #a93226; }
  #compress-wrap :global(.batch-thumb-cap) { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) { #compress-wrap { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
</style>

<script>
  import '../../scripts/image-compress/client';
</script>
